    "summary": "Bearer: an **ASURYANI** model.\n\nOnce per battle round, while the bearer leads a **GUARDIANS** or **DIRE AVENGERS** unit, you can use the [Fire Overwatch](vsdata:ability/core.fire-overwatch) Stratagem on that unit for 0CP. Its attacks then hit on an unmodified [Hit roll](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) of 5+, or of 4+ if you control an [objective marker](vsdata:core-rule/objectives) in whose range the bearer's unit stands.",
